{"id":"vod_sn_36309","vodId":"36309","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"野良神","name_cn":"野良神","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/0ed72b5783df423ea8ad084590d27b16.jpg"},"summary":"夜斗（神谷浩史 配音），是个居无定所、打着散工、穿着运动服的落魄神明，既没有神社供奉，连手下的神器也急着跳槽，他却怀着“受万民景仰”的伟大梦想，以五元香油钱为价格，接受各种各样的委托，上至砍妖除魔，下至打扫卫生。就这样，夜斗穿梭于此岸与彼岸，与八百万神明、服侍神明的“神器”、人类以及妖，共同生活在这个光怪陆离的世界中。　　一天，普通初中女生一岐日和（内田真礼 配音）因意外与夜斗结缘，为此落下了一种奇怪的体质——灵魂和身体很容易出现分离。日和拜托夜斗解决自己的问题，夜斗却烦恼着自己手下没有“神器”。不久，夜斗命中注定的神器出现了，夜斗赐其名为雪音（梶裕贵 配音）……　　本动画改编自安达渡嘉创作的同名神幻题材漫画。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:42:06","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/c0HhMp0vxM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kPCiTammFY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hqgPFy2Hep1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/d2BzUVRqdJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0pKsT01X0n1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZGE9pN8rqT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Rxt4JgX2bC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LtHf7MWTQm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KbnrTCGbLA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/psEhYhmX3t1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4FR7m63SAz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cy32yHqgCM1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:24.508Z"}